<svg viewBox="0 0 480 346" role="img" aria-labelledby="lm-title lm-desc">
  <title id="lm-title">The durable levers are the hard ones</title>
  <desc id="lm-desc">Levers placed by how hard they are to activate and how robustly they hold after the funder exits. Risk transfer and capital cost are easy to activate through contract design but hold only conditionally; this is where the field defaults. Scale and competition sit in the middle. Disintermediation and process improvement need industrial capability but hold robustly.</desc>
  <rect x="114" y="205" width="125" height="81" style="fill:#d97706; fill-opacity:0.12" />
  <line class="ax" x1="110" y1="40" x2="110" y2="290" />
  <line class="ax" x1="110" y1="290" x2="450" y2="290" />
  <text x="110" y="26" class="t-strong t-small">holds after exit</text>
  <text x="102" y="54" text-anchor="end" class="t-small">robust</text>
  <text x="102" y="286" text-anchor="end" class="t-small">conditional</text>
  <circle class="d-fin" cx="135" cy="250" r="5" /><text x="145" y="254">Risk transfer</text>
  <circle class="d-fin" cx="175" cy="222" r="5" /><text x="185" y="226">Capital cost</text>
  <text x="120" y="279" class="t-small" style="fill:#b45309">field default</text>
  <circle class="d-fin" cx="250" cy="180" r="5" /><text x="260" y="184">Scale</text>
  <circle class="d-fin" cx="285" cy="150" r="5" /><text x="295" y="154">Competition</text>
  <circle class="d-fin" cx="380" cy="110" r="5" /><text x="370" y="114" text-anchor="end">Disintermediation</text>
  <circle class="d-fin" cx="425" cy="65" r="5" /><text x="415" y="69" text-anchor="end">Process improvement</text>
  <text x="114" y="310" class="t-small">contract design</text>
  <text x="450" y="310" text-anchor="end" class="t-small">industrial capability</text>
  <text x="280" y="334" text-anchor="middle" class="t-strong t-small">harder to activate</text>
</svg>
